  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• See ‘Top Steak Tips’ (below left). Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Spread potatoes over a large microwave-safe plate. Cover with a damp paper towel. Microwave potatoes on high, 3 minutes.\n• Drain any excess liquid, then place potatoes on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over dried oregano, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly, then roast until golden and tender, 10-15 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6811859680e0f84c774d3bf0/step-1ece8900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice red onion (see ingredients).\n• In a small bowl, combine the white wine vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt.\n• Scrunch sliced onion in your hands, then add to the pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover onion. Set aside.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes. Roughly chop cucumber.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6811859680e0f84c774d3bf0/step-e0db9910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6811859680e0f84c774d3bf0/step-f4856520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a second medium bowl, combine tomato, cucumber, baby spinach leaves, a drizzle of olive oil and a splash of pickling liquid. Season to taste.\n• Drain pickled onion.\n• Slice beef rump.\n• Divide oregano potatoes, Greek-style beef rump and supergreen salad between plates. Top with pickled onion and garlic sauce. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6811859680e0f84c774d3bf0/step-2b79fa30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
